        "original_id": "bc8b809a-4d95-5540-a42c-3feaec754d17",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Garth Jennings, Lee Cheol-ha, Nick Goldsmith, Moon Geun-young, Kim Joo-hyuk\n- Organizations: Hammer & Tongs\n- Works: Love Me Not\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, producer, actor\n- Topics: British film, South Korean film\n\nFacts:\n- Garth Jennings, born in 1972, is a British film director, screenwriter, producer, and actor.\n- Lee Cheol-ha is a South Korean film director known for stylish portraits of the human experience.\n- Hammer & Tongs is the pseudonym of British director and producer duo Garth Jennings and producer Nick Goldsmith.\n- Hammer & Tongs is also the name of the production company associated with Garth Jennings and Nick Goldsmith.\n- Love Me Not is a 2006 South Korean romance film directed by Lee Cheol-ha.\n- Love Me Not stars Moon Geun-young and Kim Joo-hyuk.\n- Love Me Not literally means \"Love and Such Is Not Necessary.\"",
